    "decoded": true
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-gentle-reminders-intro.mp3",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural",
    "text": "酥酥，我们一起读《弟子规》，学着关心家人、温和地说话。",
    "bytes": 20469,
    "durationSeconds": 6.696,
    "maxVolumeDb": -3.6,
    "sha256": "b6162f3128785a758a6d727228bd77d7c9cd34009fc0a6e3602ce4fb0847bb6b",
    "decoded": true
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-gentle-line-1.mp3",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural",
    "text": "亲爱我，孝何难？亲憎我，孝方贤。",
    "bytes": 16797,
    "durationSeconds": 5.472,
    "maxVolumeDb": -5.1,
    "sha256": "f7eb3ae65541482be2cd5a11a882e08e0f6937abee1d9f6aaad5825d4c771d62",
    "decoded": true
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-gentle-line-2.mp3",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural",
    "text": "亲有过，谏使更，怡吾色，柔吾声。",
    "bytes": 14349,
    "durationSeconds": 4.656,
    "maxVolumeDb": -3.5,
    "sha256": "2e49e81737cc02e4386c4606ec0b21aebdd62a13ba24d091fec05f4a803c2a73",
    "decoded": true
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-gentle-question.mp3",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural",
    "text": "爸爸忘了关水龙头，你可以怎么提醒他？",
